Subject: [PATCH] Allow owned patcher engine to reuse compatibility contracts

Keep BasePatcher, PatcherContext and attribute identities in their original
assembly while OpenACAI owns discovery, execution and assembly lifetime.
Friend access allows metadata parsing and setting the context's dump path.

diff --git a/BepInEx.Preloader.Core/Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs b/BepInEx.Preloader.Core/Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs
--- a/BepInEx.Preloader.Core/Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs
+++ b/BepInEx.Preloader.Core/Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs
@@ -4,3 +4,4 @@ using System.Runtime.CompilerServices;
 [assembly: InternalsVisibleTo("BepInEx.NET.Framework.Launcher")]
 [assembly: InternalsVisibleTo("BepInEx.NET.CoreCLR")]
 [assembly: InternalsVisibleTo("BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP")]
+[assembly: InternalsVisibleTo("OpenACAI.Endnight.Loader.Preloader")]
